2
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:48,550
迷いの森にある本当
The truth hidden in the forest of hesitation...

3
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:52,250
逆さまに行く次の光
Heading upside down toward the next light,

4
00:03:52,450 --> 00:03:57,450
下を踏んで足場を濡らして ひとりきり夏の小道
stepping on the grass and wetting the ground, walking the lonely summer path alone.

5
00:03:57,750 --> 00:04:03,350
行くわ笑って泣いて見つめ合って 恐る恐る恋に落ちた
I'll go, laughing and crying, staring at each other, fearfully falling in love.

6
00:04:03,550 --> 00:04:08,150
ふたり歩き出した違う方へ 呼び合う声だけもどかしく
The two of us walked off in different directions, frustrated by only hearing each other's voices.

7
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:17,000
Find me in the wonderland

8
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:32,200
空の空手を手を汚して 自分の欲しいものを追いかけてみる
Soiling my hands in the sky's emptiness, trying to chase after what I truly desire.

9
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:42,200
いつもみても同じ星を感じる
Staying forever and feeling the exact same star.

10
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:47,800
ふたりになる寂しさが今夜になって また明るい夢の踊り
The loneliness of becoming two turns into tonight's bright, dancing dream again,

11
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:52,800
飛び込んで残した心だって ここから始まる歌になる
diving in and leaving even my heart behind, turning it into a song starting right here.

12
00:05:00,268 --> 00:05:05,128
どこまでもさ どこへ行こうか あなたは笑う
Let's go anywhere, anywhere at all, you smile and say.

13
00:05:06,248 --> 00:05:10,148
踏み出してみようか 後ろめたさと
Shall we take a step forward, with a bit of guilt

14
00:05:10,148 --> 00:05:14,928
私を誘う funny in the wonderland
Luring me into a funny in the wonderland?

15
00:05:32,408 --> 00:05:36,168
どうしたって 生まれ変わる
No matter what, being reborn

16
00:05:36,788 --> 00:05:43,608
音の強い意志が いつようなわ心臓の命だった
A strong will of sound was the life of my beating heart.

17
00:05:44,008 --> 00:05:48,808
私だけじゃ道は いつからだの星を数え繋がり合わせ
Counting the distant stars to weave our paths together

18
00:05:51,808 --> 00:05:55,808
まだ知らない 夏の星座
Under a summer constellation we've never known.

19
00:05:56,408 --> 00:06:02,808
見つめ合って 手を差して どこから始まる物語
Gazing at each other, reaching out our hands—where does this story begin?

20
00:06:03,208 --> 00:06:08,808
もう一人がじゃないのよ 夢のようでしょう 私を歌う
It's not just one of us, isn't it like a dream? I sing out.

21
00:06:11,808 --> 00:06:19,408
寂しさは昼の襟 旗の元へと 二人は都合
Loneliness turns into day's collar, heading to the flag where the two of us gather.

22
00:06:20,408 --> 00:06:27,608
なにも思い通りにならないことが 始まったから
Because things started not going the way we wished.

23
00:06:28,008 --> 00:06:36,208
踏み出してみようか 目隠しおりの 手の鳴る方へ
Shall we take a step forward, blindfolded toward the sound of clapping hands?

24
00:06:37,408 --> 00:06:41,608
in your wonderland

25
00:06:54,808 --> 00:07:01,208
あなたが迷う場所に 明かりを灯し風
Lighting a lamp in the place where you get lost, sending a wind

26
00:07:02,008 --> 00:07:06,808
あなたば一つといて 気味悪く笑いましょう
Unraveling one of you, let's smile weirdly together.

27
00:07:09,608 --> 00:07:15,208
もう一人じゃないのよ とても怖いね 幸せなんて
You're not alone anymore, how terrifying true happiness is.

28
00:07:18,008 --> 00:07:25,608
寂しさは昼の襟 旗の元へと 二人は都合
Loneliness turns into day's collar, heading to the flag where the two of us gather.

29
00:07:26,408 --> 00:07:33,208
世界は君のものさ 手が解けて あなたがいて
The world belongs to you, our hands parting, with you right here.

30
00:07:34,208 --> 00:07:41,808
踏み出してみようか 愛する人が 私を誘う
Shall we take a step forward, as the person I love invites me

31
00:07:42,208 --> 00:07:46,408
funny in the wonderland

32
00:07:46,808 --> 00:07:50,008
in your wonderland

33
00:07:54,008 --> 00:08:00,008
綺麗な吐息になって
Becoming a beautiful sigh...

34
00:08:01,808 --> 00:08:06,008
あなたの歌を歌って
Singing your song.

35
00:08:39,508 --> 00:08:45,008
[Title: delete]

36
00:08:40,008 --> 00:08:45,008
[Text: Lyrics・Composition: 梶浦由記]
[Text: Lyrics・Composition: Yuki Kajiura]

37
00:08:49,208 --> 00:08:57,208
優しい言葉を なくした闇の中
In the darkness where I lost gentle words

38
00:08:59,008 --> 00:09:09,608
最後の祈りも 静かに消えていった 夜明けは遠く
My final prayer also quietly faded away, dawn is still far off

39
00:09:10,008 --> 00:09:18,008
君は一人 出口のない 夢の中で
You are all alone within a dream with no exit

40
00:09:18,808 --> 00:09:29,208
涙だけが 道を照らした 誰にも届かずついにゆく男が
Only tears lit the path, and the one heading on without reaching anyone...

41
00:09:30,008 --> 00:09:42,208
悲しみひとつも 叶うの目覚めに終わる 声もなく君はただ泣いた
Even sorrow ends upon awakening, you wept silently without a voice.

42
00:09:46,008 --> 00:09:54,008
君はただ泣いた
You just wept.

43
00:10:01,049 --> 00:10:06,169
ルイズが 傷ついて
Louis got hurt

44
00:10:10,529 --> 00:10:17,489
誰かが 数を 数えた
Someone counted the numbers

45
00:10:28,109 --> 00:10:36,849
光をもたらす さだめの人は来ない
The one destined to bring light won't come

46
00:10:40,109 --> 00:10:46,349
時間は まだらに 孤立して
Time is mottled and isolated

47
00:10:47,349 --> 00:10:53,129
恐れを解いた 剣を手に抱きしめ合う
Embracing each other with swords freed from fear

48
00:10:53,689 --> 00:10:58,289
形を知って 君と 僕は 傷を 重ねた
Knowing our shapes, you and I piled up our wounds

49
00:11:00,849 --> 00:11:07,949
どこにも 届かかず 君の 声は 水底へ 消えてゆく
Reaching nowhere, your voice fades away to the lake bed

50
00:11:11,209 --> 00:11:18,309
ことばさえ 誰の 傷痕の ままに
Even words remain as someone's scars

51
00:11:19,509 --> 00:11:29,089
無情に筋を 増やした
Increased lines mercilessly

52
00:11:36,049 --> 00:11:43,109
いつか 光の なか で
Someday inside the light

53
00:11:46,049 --> 00:11:54,689
そばに 居てくれると 信じて
Believing you'll stay by my side

54
00:12:14,389 --> 00:12:26,529
形のない 僕たちは 形の ある 世界へと
Formless us to a world with form

55
00:12:30,149 --> 00:12:39,169
いつか 変える 道を探した 忘れてしまった
Looked for the way back someday, but forgot

56
00:12:41,989 --> 00:12:54,509
優しい 声を探して 彷徨う 道は どこまで 遠い
Searching for a gentle voice, how far is the wandering path?

57
00:12:55,769 --> 00:13:09,129
恋もなく 君は ただ 泣いた 道は やがて 凍えた
Without even love, you just cried, the path eventually froze

58
00:13:16,909 --> 00:13:25,149
いつか 光の中で…
Someday inside the light...

59
00:13:36,149 --> 00:13:46,469
わあ！ Good morning, afternoon, evening! おはよう、こんにちは、こんばんは！ Welcome to my birthday live! Yay!
Wah! Good morning, afternoon, evening! Good morning, afternoon, evening! Welcome to my birthday live! Yay!

60
00:13:46,469 --> 00:13:49,209
It's finally happening!

61
00:13:49,869 --> 00:13:51,709
はあ...
*sigh*...

62
00:13:51,709 --> 00:14:01,509
Thank you guys for being so patient. I know this was originally planned for around May, around my birthday, but it's finally happening in December!

63
00:14:01,729 --> 00:14:07,709
Thank you so much, everyone, for being patient and supporting me so this could happen.

64
00:14:07,909 --> 00:14:16,649
Thank you so, so much Staff-san for all your hard work! I'm so happy and I'm so nervous, can you tell?

65
00:14:17,389 --> 00:14:29,849
So, did you guys enjoy the first two songs, Wonderland and Delete?

66
00:14:29,849 --> 00:14:36,229
Wonderland is aimer songs, it's not Ina's live without an Aimer song.
Wonderland is an Aimer song, it's not an Ina's live without an Aimer song.

67
00:14:36,449 --> 00:14:44,309
I don't think it's as well known, but it's definitely one of my favorite songs by her, so I wanted to perform it for you guys someday.

68
00:14:44,309 --> 00:14:52,249
And Delete, it's actually an insert song in the Sword Art Online movie Ordinal Scale,

69
00:14:52,249 --> 00:14:58,349
and I really liked the song in the movie, and I, you know, I wanted to perform it for you guys.

70
00:14:58,569 --> 00:15:00,040
Both of them are too...
Both of them are...

71
00:15:00,428 --> 00:15:04,558
Anyways, I hope you'll have a lot of fun during the live.

72
00:15:04,668 --> 00:15:07,208
Let's enjoy our trip through Neverland together.

73
00:15:07,378 --> 00:15:08,438
Never-Everland.

74
00:15:08,598 --> 00:15:09,938
Never-ever-everland.

75
00:15:10,048 --> 00:15:13,088
Never-ever-never-ever-ever-neverland.

76
00:15:13,088 --> 00:15:13,908
Yeah.

77
00:15:13,938 --> 00:15:14,958
Let's go!

78
00:17:18,256 --> 00:17:22,036
ダミーダミー
Dummy dummy

79
00:17:29,716 --> 00:17:35,826
ダミーじゃできないことを探してみたいよ
I want to search for something that a dummy can't do

80
00:17:36,596 --> 00:17:47,556
ダミーじゃなくていい 何かを でもその答えを探せば探すほど 誰かと笑ってる僕を殺したくなる
It doesn't have to be a dummy, but the more I search for that answer, the more I want to kill the me who's smiling with someone else

81
00:17:53,966 --> 00:18:02,186
1＋1 違い 一番温かくしよう
1 + 1 is different, let's make it the warmest

82
00:18:04,326 --> 00:18:16,836
僕はそう燃えて 誰かに縛られてる時が一番美しいと思ったんだ
I thought I was the most beautiful when I was burning and bound to someone

83
00:18:18,616 --> 00:18:24,516
ダミーじゃできないことがたくさんある 1人でできることが多すぎて
There are so many things a dummy can't do, there are too many things I can do by myself

84
00:18:30,366 --> 00:18:38,276
だから僕がもっと大量に必要だよ そして誰かに僕の役を押し付けた
That's why I need a lot more of me, and I forced my role onto someone else

85
00:18:40,016 --> 00:18:46,426
僕の声は一言も華麗になれないれない だからここで誰かが演じる僕を見てるよ
My voice cannot become gorgeous even a single word, so I'm watching someone else play me right here

86
00:18:47,906 --> 00:18:55,726
僕はそう燃いたくて 誰かが演じる僕が僕のそれより美しく輝いているから
I want to burn like that, because the me played by someone else shines more beautifully than my own

87
00:18:58,846 --> 00:19:05,536
僕によく似たあなたに僕をプレゼントするよ
I will present myself to you, who looks so much like me

88
00:19:05,536 --> 00:19:15,366
虚しくなったら外に出て レインにくるまってまた
When it gets empty, go outside, wrap yourself in rain, and once again

89
00:19:17,406 --> 00:19:29,846
僕の代わりに誰かが演じる僕が 僕のそれより美しく輝いているから
Because the me played by someone else in my place shines more beautifully than my own

90
00:19:30,146 --> 00:19:44,426
僕によく似たあなたに僕をプレゼントするよ 虚しくなったら外に出て レインにくるまってまた
I will present myself to you, who looks so much like me. When it gets empty, go outside, wrap yourself in rain, and once again

91
00:19:44,426 --> 00:19:59,056
愛が欲しくなったら ここに狂い来るんだ Hey you!
If you want love, come and go crazy right here, hey you!

92
00:20:26,532 --> 00:20:30,532
[Title: こちら、幸福安心委員会です。]
[Title: This is the Happiness and Peace of Mind Committee.]

93
00:20:56,546 --> 00:21:02,156
童話して みんなが幸せなの この世界の こと
Is it a fairy tale that everyone is happy in this world?

94
00:21:06,886 --> 00:21:09,986
聞きたいって 知りたいって
You want to hear it? You want to know?

95
00:21:10,626 --> 00:21:14,396
水辺の公園で みんなが耳を澄ませて
Everyone is straining their ears at the waterside park.

96
00:21:19,376 --> 00:21:25,826
ワクワクするね ねぇ Onm-Dee-No
It's exciting, isn't it? Hey, Onm-Dee-No...

97
00:21:27,456 --> 00:21:29,866
はい！ はーい！
Yes! YEEES!

98
00:21:30,436 --> 00:21:35,346
さぁさぁ皆さん 教えてあげます 皆は決まっている こと
Come on, everyone, I'll teach you. Everyone has their predetermined path...

99
00:21:35,646 --> 00:21:41,046
希望を持っている こと 全部教えてあげます
And their hopes. I'll tell you all about it!

100
00:21:41,906 --> 00:21:47,806
えぇ皆さんが 幸福の葉木野なんです 幸せですか？ 君ですよ！
Well, everyone is the Hakino of happiness. Are you happy? Yes, you!

101
00:21:48,106 --> 00:21:51,406
聞いてますよ わかってるんですか？
Are you listening? Do you understand?

102
00:21:51,706 --> 00:21:55,806
我々幸福安心委員会は 皆様の幸せを願い そして支えます
We, the Happiness and Peace of Mind Committee, wish for your happiness and support you.

103
00:21:56,436 --> 00:22:02,216
幸福なのは木野なんです 幸せですか？ 君ですよ！ わかっているでしょ？
Happiness is Kino! Are you happy? It's you! You know that, right?

104
00:22:03,386 --> 00:22:08,146
幸福なのは木野なんです だから安心して 木の葉のように
Happiness is Kino! So rest easy, like leaves on a tree...

105
00:22:09,146 --> 00:22:14,916
皆様の幸せが 我々の幸せ 幸せですか？ 君ですよ！ 分かっていますか？
Your happiness is our happiness. Are you happy? It's you! Do you understand?

106
00:22:15,606 --> 00:22:21,106
安心してください 木の下ですよ 皆様の幸せが 我々の幸せ
Please rest assured, you're under the tree. Your happiness is our happiness.

107
00:22:21,606 --> 00:22:25,306
幸せですか？ 君ですよ！ 分かっていますか？
Are you happy? It's you! Do you understand?

108
00:22:25,896 --> 00:22:33,436
国士無双 十三雀 鳴き手役満 溺死 轢死 絞り球 刺殺 撲殺 一日鋸 貼り付け 好きなのを選んでね
Kokushi Musou, 13 sparrows, yakuman, drowning, being run over, strangulation, stabbing, bludgeoning, a day with a saw, crucifixion—choose your favorite!

109
00:22:34,236 --> 00:22:39,156
はい！ はーい！ さぁさぁ皆さん 幸せだらけにしています
Yes! YEEES! Come on, everyone, we're filling you with happiness!

110
00:22:40,436 --> 00:22:44,786
不安とか 不安なこと 何一つないでしょ？
There's not a single thing to worry about, right?

111
00:22:45,106 --> 00:22:50,106
怖い？ 怖いわ 幸せすぎて 怖いわ
Scared? It's scary... It's so full of happiness that it's scary.

112
00:23:33,396 --> 00:23:39,186
本当の みんなが幸せなの この世界の 外
Is everyone truly happy outside of this world?

113
00:23:44,606 --> 00:23:47,916
行きたいって 逃げたいって
You want to go? You want to escape?

114
00:23:48,806 --> 00:23:52,576
水辺の公園で みんなが耳を塞いで
Everyone is blocking their ears at the waterside park.

115
00:23:57,506 --> 00:24:03,416
ぴくぴくしてたね ねぇ Onm-Dee-No
You were twitching, weren't you? Hey, Onm-Dee-No...

116
00:24:04,316 --> 00:24:06,796
はい！ はーい！
Yes! YEEES!

117
00:24:07,446 --> 00:24:14,976
さぁさぁ皆さん 死にました！ 大きに おきはきみは 死にました！ ソロに出るなら 飛行にならずに
Come on, everyone, you died! Thank goodness, you died! If you're going solo, don't fly off...

118
00:24:15,426 --> 00:24:17,956
それ以外は 幸せに暮らして
Other than that, live happily.

119
00:24:18,526 --> 00:24:20,946
以上 幸福安心委員会は
That's all from the Happiness and Peace of Mind Committee.

120
00:24:21,086 --> 00:24:25,786
幸福なのは木野なんです 幸せですか？ 君ですよ！
Happiness is Kino! Are you happy? Yes, you!

121
00:24:26,366 --> 00:24:31,096
幸福なのは木野なんです 幸福なのは木野なんです
Happiness is Kino! Happiness is Kino!

122
00:24:31,986 --> 00:24:36,666
幸福なのは木野なんです 幸せですか？ 君ですよ！
Happiness is Kino! Are you happy? Yes, you!

123
00:24:36,966 --> 00:24:47,316
幸福なのは木野なんです 幸せですか？ 君ですよ！ 国士無双 十三雀 鳴き手役満 溺死 轢死 絞り球 刺殺 撲殺 一日鋸 貼り付け 好きなのを選んでね
Happiness is Kino! Are you happy? It's you! Kokushi Musou, 13 sparrows, yakuman, drowning, being run over, strangulation, stabbing, bludgeoning, a day with a saw, crucifixion—choose your favorite!

124
00:24:47,516 --> 00:24:51,032
幸せじゃないなら、死ね。
If you're not happy, just die.

125
00:25:27,243 --> 00:25:30,473
錆び付いたワイヤー 裂き縫ったのよ
I tore and stitched up a rusted wire...

126
00:25:31,853 --> 00:25:35,233
色褪せた同胞たちの航空写真に
...into the aerial photograph of my faded brethren.

127
00:25:37,423 --> 00:25:40,843
そう 今 歪い正義を 飼い鳴らして
So right now, I'm taming this distorted justice,

128
00:25:42,403 --> 00:25:46,103
不条理に因果の大償を 払い共に行こう
paying the heavy price of cause and effect for this absurdity as we go together.

129
00:25:48,493 --> 00:25:51,613
切り刻まれる夜 再び逢えた月
The night is being carved up, the moon meets us once more,

130
00:25:53,683 --> 00:25:57,163
哀れんで 私を ねぇ そんなに驚かないで
pity me... Hey, don't look so surprised.

131
00:25:59,083 --> 00:26:02,173
その日の旋律 雨はまたやまない
